+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+On a 5,000-record store, the `SessionStart` hook cost **16.193769 ms p50** before `PRAGMA quick_check` was removed from the read path. After the read path switched to the recorded `quick_check` result and the trigger-maintained `fts_rows` counter, it cost **0.911331 ms p50**.
+
+These are measured end-to-end hook times from 101 runs of `muninn-bench perf --records 5000 --cues 15000 --runs 101`. The `fts_rows` counter and the `CHECK (length(body) <= 2000)` constraint were added in the same change as the `quick_check` read-path removal, so this measurement describes the bundled before/after change and does not isolate the cost of each part.
